# Lines 11-18: pi, e, sqrt(2), ln(2), phi with >= 3 decimals must fire.
# Lines 19/20 have only two decimals (3.14, 2.71), 21 is unrelated, 22 only
# ENDS in 2.718 (12.718) and must not fire.
# Known FP shape: a literal that is genuinely a measured value (a size table
# with 1.618); suppress with dl:ok.
approx-constant 11
approx-constant 12
approx-constant 13
approx-constant 14
approx-constant 15
approx-constant 16
approx-constant 17
approx-constant 18
!approx-constant 19
!approx-constant 20
!approx-constant 21
!approx-constant 22
